*E_NAME		"Eura Warehouse Keeper"

*E_CHAT		"I am worried about storing items.   They may be frozen by this weather!"
*E_CHAT         "Well, here is your stuff."
*E_CHAT         "You come this far, are you famous   warrior in the continent?"
*E_CHAT         "It's even colder to the north. Are  you going there now?"
